{
  "title": "The Witch of Disaster Wants to Live Freely",
  "description": "[The strongest witch who was turned into a villain is now back as a child to start over!]\n\nRiesz, a peerless archmage, lost her life as a human sacrifice to seal a magical disaster known as the \"Magic Abyss\".\n\nA hundred years later, she manages to return to life, only to find that the Magic Abyss' influence has transformed her back into a young girl.\n\nFrom a kind-hearted adventurer named El, saved by Riesz, she learns that due to the Church's schemes 100 years ago, she has been falsely branded as the arch-criminal \"Witch of Disaster\". Though outraged by this revelation, Riesz decides to enjoy her second chance at life.\n\nA refreshing fantasy where the strongest mage reigns supreme! ",
  "artist": "Aoki Mitsura",
  "author": "Nekoko",
  "cover": "https://mangadex.org/covers/38b4b1e5-16e8-4136-a830-9b6d259b1033/78c0e8f0-d440-4d83-bd81-61822be563c5.jpg",
